    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p>你习得下列一项你选择的戏法：<em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">舞光术Dacing Lights</em> 、 <em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">光亮术Light</em> 、或 <em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">圣火术Sacred Flame</em> 。你施展该戏法的施法属性为智力、感知、或魅力。（选择此种族的时候决定）。</p></div><p>You know one of the following cantrips of your choice: @UUID[.UoaAvBDsbOg3WKHT], @spell[light], or @spell[sacred flame]. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you select this race).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
